Directory of "Mail:Fido/other/":

    These four files I haven't found a use for, but thought I would include
    them in the event you had a use for them.

    - enumnodes

        - This one seems to take a REGION and/or REGION/HUB as input, upon
          which it lists all nodes within that REGION or within the HUB of
          that REGION.

    - listpasswd

        - If a Node in the NodeList has a password, this file will show it
          to you. (Passwords are usually unique to YOU, meaning if a node
          states you need a password, then only YOU can access their node
          using the password in YOUR NodeList)

    - setconfig

        - Not quite sure WHAT this one does. I think it might have to do with
          the modem flags associated to a given node?

    - setpasswd

        - This one is used to assign a password to a particular node in the
          NodeList, if you've been told that from now on you'll need to use
          a password to connect to a given node.

